BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:psara-psara-carnival-boules-and-the-alani-psara-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270314
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270315
SUMMARY:Carnival 'boules' and the 'alani'\, Psara
LOCATION:Psara\, Psara\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Through the weekends of the Triodion and on Tsiknopempti\, masked 'boules' in improvised costumes go from house to house\; on the final carnival Sunday the village sets tables in a circle in the big square (the 'alani')\, men and women at separate tables\, with ouzo\, mezedes\, spinach pies and hours of carnival and folk songs. Winter ferries permitting\, it is the most intimate carnival in the Aegean.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/psara/#psara-carnival-boules-and-the-alani-psara
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/psara/#psara-carnival-boules-and-the-alani-psara
END:VEVENT
